Phase 5: memory CLI + evening briefing

- jarvis memory list | search <q> | forget <id> | undo | export [file] | wipe [--yes]:
  the second brain becomes directly manageable from the CLI. forget stashes
  the note for undo (memory-undo.json); undo restores it; export writes
  JSON; wipe clears all (requires explicit confirm or --yes).
- sentinel.py: compose_evening_briefing — today's recap, unfinished board
  tasks, health line, daily reminder count for tomorrow; run_sentinel
  gains an optional evening_time parameter.
- Morning briefing recaps the most recent recorded session (continuity).
- Tests: stash/undo round trip, export content, wipe, evening briefing
  content, morning briefing intact.
